      "text": "输入\n                            5\r\n2 1 3 5 4\n                        \n                        \n                            输出\n                            0 0 2 3 3\n                        \n\n                                                    \n                                输入\n                                12\r\n11 14 4 15 18 11 9 11 8 9 8 12 \n                            \n                            \n                                输出\n                                0 1 0 3 4 2 1 4 1 3 2 8\n                            \n                        \n                                                    \n                                输入\n                                16\r\n19 0 3 8 10 7 4 8 20 7 14 6 0 20 6 2\n                            \n                            \n                                输出\n                                0 0 1 2 3 2 2 5 8 4 8 3 1 13 5 2"
